# Send only files required by server/Dockerfile. This prevents local clipboard
# data, auth material, environment files, VCS metadata, and app build output
# from reaching local or remote Docker builders.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock

!crates/
!crates/**

!server/
!server/Cargo.toml
!server/Dockerfile
!server/src/
!server/src/**
!server/ui/
!server/ui/.npmrc
!server/ui/index.html
!server/ui/package.json
!server/ui/package-lock.json
!server/ui/vite.config.js
!server/ui/public/
!server/ui/public/**
!server/ui/src/
!server/ui/src/**

# Cargo resolves every workspace member even when only the server is built.
!src-tauri/
!src-tauri/Cargo.toml
!src-tauri/src/
!src-tauri/src/lib.rs

# Re-including a directory above re-includes everything below it, so runtime
# data, secrets and build output must be excluded again. Later rules win.
**/copywraith-data
# The server's default data directory is ./data, so a run from server/
# creates server/data. Its secrets are also excluded by name, wherever
# COPYWRAITH_DATA_DIR pointed.
server/data
**/auth.json
**/copywraith.db*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.env
**/.env.*
server/tests
crates/*/android
src-tauri/gen
**/.svelte-check
